WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.059
Right, Tim here.

2
00:00:01.059 --> 00:00:04.037
A quick catch up on what's new in Touchline.

3
00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.956
No test at the end, promise.

4
00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:07.164
Subs first.

5
00:00:07.164 --> 00:00:12.313
Tap Subs and 100 Club on the home page and it takes you straight to TeamFeePay.

6
00:00:12.313 --> 00:00:18.107
There's a reminder on it that it's for the U15 Blues, so nobody pays into the wrong team.

7
00:00:18.607 --> 00:00:20.798
The 100 Club is three pounds a month.

8
00:00:20.798 --> 00:00:26.841
Sixty percent of the prize goes to the winner, and half of everything raised goes back into the club.

9
00:00:26.841 --> 00:00:30.336
Please share the link with family, friends and neighbours.

10
00:00:30.836 --> 00:00:34.140
My own training is for the lads, and for you if you fancy it.

11
00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:37.823
There are home sessions, good football sites and a fitness planner.

12
00:00:37.823 --> 00:00:43.348
If your lad wants help with shooting or first touch, he can ask in the app and we'll send him a clip.

13
00:00:43.848 --> 00:00:47.916
The tabs along the top scroll sideways, so give them a swipe.

14
00:00:47.916 --> 00:00:50.784
Every page has a short how this works box.

15
00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:52.051
It's worth a read.

16
00:00:52.551 --> 00:00:54.912
Our sponsor's in the top right corner.

17
00:00:54.912 --> 00:00:56.156
Do give them a nod.

18
00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.958
That's it, see you Saturday.

